{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>中環國際金融中心二期有人懷疑使用假鈔。（Google地圖截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>中環國金有人懷疑使用假鈔。 今日（21日）中午12時53分，一名男子手持7張面額1,000元的紙幣，到中環國際金融中心二期一間銀行櫃位表示要開戶口，職員懷疑是偽鈔，於是報警。警方接報後到場，經調查後，以涉嫌「行使虛假文書」將一名七旬內地老翁拘捕，他被帶返警署繼續調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T09:21:09.024508+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T08:29:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T10:17:51.042944+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:17:43.353596+00:00","content_hash":"582bbd2cffd7473416c56f4673aeb727cc81fc4400a20e5e7ad35b9dc3a6a4af","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}